The film was distributed by Troma Entertainment.

12
01:08:28,235 --> 01:08:34,235
The plot of the film takes place in Staten Island, and follows an unemployed Vietnam veteran named Frankie Dunlan living in total
poverty with his nagging wife, his baby (who is deformed due to Frankie's exposure to Agent Orange), and junkie friends.

13
01:14:10,588 --> 01:14:16,588
Unable to get a job and surrounded by the depravity of urban life
and crime, he begins to lose his grip on sanity.

14
01:19:52,941 --> 01:19:58,941
The film received mixed to negative reviews upon its release, but
has since gained a cult following among Troma Fans.

15
01:25:35,294 --> 01:25:41,294
The film explores themes of vietnam, post-traumatic stress
disorder (ptsd), nihilism, flashback, poverty.

16
01:31:17,647 --> 01:31:23,647
The tone is intense and dark and emotional.
